/T (The SchoolWell card set is complemented by the SchoolWell app, which provides an additional, interactive tool to support student and teacher well-being. The app allows for the use of cards in digital spaces and facilitates regular engagement with topics related to emotions, relationships, mindfulness, and mental health.)
